  type_choices_err_duplicate.pcpp - break step of type_choices.pcpp:
  a value name is used once in its list (SM0004)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\type_choices_err_duplicate.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\type_choices_err_duplicate.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
